  "tag": "N",
  "thought": false,
  "note": "",
  "text": "Every umbrella at the stop pops open. Except Eli's. In this world, an umbrella only opens if someone is waiting for you to get home.",
  "voice": "am_michael",
  "speed": 1.03,
  "ids": [
   "L001",
   "L002"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "G002",
  "tag": "WOMAN",
  "thought": false,
  "note": "",
  "text": "Oh. Sorry, love.",
  "voice": "af_sarah",
  "speed": 1.05,
  "ids": [
   "L003"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "G003",
  "tag": "N",
  "thought": false,
  "note": "",
  "text": "He shakes it. He bangs it. It stays shut. He checks his phone. No messages. He's lived alone since the spring.",
  "voice": "am_michael",
  "speed": 1.03,
  "ids": [
   "L004",
   "L005"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "G004",
  "tag": "N",
  "thought": false,
  "note": "",
  "text": "So he walks home. Forty minutes. Soaked to the bone. He tells himself it doesn't matter. Umbrellas are for tourists.",
  "voice": "am_michael",
  "speed": 1.03,
  "ids": [
   "L006",
   "L007"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "G005",
  "tag": "ELI",
  "thought": false,
  "note": "",
  "text": "What? Who\u2026?",
  "voice": "am_echo",
  "speed": 1.05,
  "ids": [
   "L008"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "G006",
  "tag": "N",
  "thought": false,
  "note": "",
  "text": "Halfway home, it bursts open on its own.",
  "voice": "am_michael",
  "speed": 1.03,
  "ids": [
   "L009"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "G007",
  "tag": "N",
  "thought": false,
  "note": "",
  "text": "In his front window, Pepper is waiting. Fourteen years old. Deaf in one ear. He's been sitting at the glass since six.",
  "voice": "am_michael",
  "speed": 1.03,
  "ids": [
   "L010",
   "L011"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "G008",
  "tag": "ELI",
  "thought": false,
  "note": "",
  "text": "Hey, old man. You waited for me?",
  "voice": "am_echo",
  "speed": 1.05,
  "ids": [
   "L012"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "G009",
  "tag": "N",
  "thought": false,
  "note": "",
  "text": "Eli doesn't buy a new umbrella. He doesn't need one.",
  "voice": "am_michael",
  "speed": 1.03,
  "ids": [
